WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.700
Your AI agent can browse the web.

00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:06.500
Right up until it hits a login page.

00:00:06.362 --> 00:00:08.700
Then you get two bad options:

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:11.350
hand it your password, or babysit it.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.400
Auth Your Agent is the third option.

00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:16.725
One rule:

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:19.550
your agent never sees your password, and

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.675
anything that changes something waits for

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.675
your thumb.

00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:26.488
On most websites, your agent works in the

00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:27.250
vault:

00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:29.962
a sandboxed browser, in Docker, on your

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.200
own machine.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.163
If you keep your logins in Bitwarden or

00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:37.837
Vaultwarden, the vault can type a saved

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.387
password or authenticator code for your

00:00:40.087 --> 00:00:41.300
agent.

00:00:41.163 --> 00:00:43.925
The agent only names the item.

00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:45.975
It never sees the value.

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:50.088
Anything a saved login can't handle, like

00:00:49.788 --> 00:00:52.925
a captcha, a texted code, or a site you

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:55.575
haven't saved, goes to your phone.

00:00:55.437 --> 00:00:58.538
It buzzes, you see the live page, sign in

00:00:58.238 --> 00:01:00.325
yourself, and hand it back.

00:01:01.675 --> 00:01:03.400
Reading is free.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.000
But when it clicks something that would

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.037
change something, like submit or buy, that

00:01:07.737 --> 00:01:10.475
click is held until you tap Approve, or

00:01:10.175 --> 00:01:11.375
Deny.

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.450
When the job is done, the vault signs out,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.100
checks that it worked, and wipes the browser.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.775
Websites can also build it in:

00:01:21.613 --> 00:01:24.300
a sign in with your agent button.

00:01:24.162 --> 00:01:27.613
The agent signs with its own key, you approve

00:01:27.313 --> 00:01:30.337
with a passkey, and the site gets short-lived

00:01:30.037 --> 00:01:32.825
tokens tied to that one agent.

00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:35.600
Auth Your Agent.

00:01:35.437 --> 00:01:38.875
The vault and MCP server are free and open

00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:39.625
source.

00:01:39.475 --> 00:01:42.300
Find it at auth your agent dot com.
